    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MC ALISTER: It's my area of specialty, yes. They're a truly fascinating animal.\nKERNS: Otherwise known as \"killing machines,\" right?\nMC ALISTER: It's just an animal trying to survive. Nothing more. More people are killed by lightning every year than by sharks. |",
      "KERNS: Oh shit...\nMC ALISTER: Equipment room is just back there. We need spearguns, flare pistols... anything we can find.",
      "MC ALISTER: They've been almost half an hour.\nKERNS: Yeah. I'm not going out there.\nMC ALISTER: We need another option.\nMC ALISTER: Got to get out! Shark in lab...next door!"
    ]
